      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "[![DIIT - UNLaM]([embedded image omitted])](https://ingenieria.unlam.edu.ar/)   \n[![by-nc-sa_80x15.png]([embedded image omitted])](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\n2025\n[Víctor A. Bettachini](mailto:vbettachini@unlam.edu.ar)   \n\n---",
      "sourceSha256": "f081ffae69a4840e3582f9d7f30920d7a207011b27614420d57e1708a39d01b6",
